  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: \\(x^2+y^2+9 x-8 y+5=0\\)\nCentre circle \\((-2,4)\\)\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/IrPVNzbE5UZz2YIP_XO_M5ZN0aKLk3KvBeQhE-Vx7Yw.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{\\mathrm{h}+2}{2}=-2 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~h}=-4-2=-6 \\\\\n& \\frac{\\mathrm{k}+1}{2}=4 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{k}=7 \\\\\n& (\\mathrm{~h}, \\mathrm{k}) \\rightarrow(-6,7)\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
